---
import LegalSection from "../components/LegalSection.astro";
import { EFFECTIVE_DATE, SUPPORT_EMAIL } from "../config";
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

const SECTIONS = [
  {
    heading: "Tenant isolation",
    body: [
      "Every workspace is a separate tenant. Each authenticated request carries the organization it belongs to, and every query is scoped to that organization at the data layer rather than filtered in the interface. A record created in one workspace has no path to another, including through search, export, analytics, and AI features.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Access control",
    items: [
      "Roles are owner, liaison, and admission manager, assigned per member by a workspace owner. Permissions are checked on the server for every request, not just hidden in the interface.",
      "Sessions are short-lived and expire automatically after inactivity. Signing out revokes the session immediately.",
      "Sign-in supports email with one-time verification codes and Google sign-in. Password reset is time-limited and single-use.",
      "Invitations are scoped to a single organization and a single role, and expire if unused.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Protecting health information",
    items: [
      "Fields carrying protected health information are encrypted at rest with per-field encryption, so a database-level disclosure does not yield readable PHI.",
      "All traffic between your browser and Refidly runs over TLS.",
      "Uploaded files, including Smart Scan business card images, are stored in access-controlled object storage and served through short-lived signed URLs rather than public links.",
      "Application logs are written to exclude protected health information and credentials.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Audit history",
    body: [
      "Record mutations are written to an audit trail that captures who changed what and when. Field-level history is visible inside the application, and a deleted record can be restored from history within the retention window. Audit entries are retained longer than the records themselves, because their purpose is to answer questions after the fact.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "AI processing",
    body: [
      "AI features call Google's Gemini models and run only when a user triggers them. Prompts are built inside the requesting organization's scope, workspace content is never used to train models, and processing is transient. AI output is decision support and should be reviewed by a person before it is acted on.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Infrastructure and vendors",
    items: [
      "Refidly runs on managed cloud infrastructure in the United States, with encrypted storage and automated backups.",
      "Payments are handled by Stripe. Card numbers never reach Refidly servers.",
      "Transactional email is sent through Resend. Outreach email is sent through the customer's own connected Google or Microsoft mailbox.",
      "Each subprocessor is under contract and is listed in the Privacy Policy.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "HIPAA and Business Associate Agreements",
    body: [
      "Where a customer is a covered entity or business associate and Refidly handles protected health information on its behalf, Refidly acts as a business associate and will execute a Business Associate Agreement. The BAA governs PHI handling and prevails over any conflicting term in the Customer Agreement.",
      "Until a BAA is in place, do not configure workspace fields to hold protected health information. Request one from the address below and we will send the current form.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Reporting a vulnerability",
    body: [
      "If you believe you have found a security issue, tell us before telling anyone else. Send the affected URL or endpoint, what you observed, and the steps to reproduce. We acknowledge reports within two business days and will keep you updated until the issue is resolved.",
      "Please test only against your own account or a trial workspace. Do not access another organization's data, do not run automated scans or load tests against production, and do not exfiltrate, alter, or destroy data. We will not pursue action against researchers who follow these rules and report in good faith.",
    ],
  },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Security and HIPAA — Refidly"
  description="How Refidly isolates tenants, controls access, encrypts protected health information, audits changes, and handles Business Associate Agreements."
  heading="Security at Refidly"
  lead="Referral records are among the most sensitive data a healthcare organization keeps. Here is how the platform handles them."
  updated={EFFECTIVE_DATE}
>
  {SECTIONS.map((section) => <LegalSection {...section} />)}

  <LegalSection heading="Contact">
    <p class="legal-body">
      Vulnerability reports, BAA requests, security questionnaires, and
      procurement reviews all go to <a
        href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}
        class="legal-link">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a
      >. Put "Security" in the subject line so it reaches the right team first.
    </p>
  </LegalSection>
</LegalLayout>
